    "body_html": "<h2 class=\"p1\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z88V5AQakYM?si=kawCB_ILZS3UJbEf\" title=\"YouTube video player\"></iframe></h2>\n<h2 class=\"p1\">The Perfect Blend of Power and Motion!</h2>\n<p class=\"p1\">The Ebonite Spartan has quietly earned a reputation as one of the line's most trusted high-performance options, and now the <span class=\"s1\"><b>Spartan Pearl</b></span> takes that to another level. Designed to fill a key gap in the lineup, this shiny asymmetric offers the best of both worlds: a strong, reliable midlane paired with an angular move downlane. The powerful Iron Fist V2 core ensures enough flare and traction through the lane, while the responsive cover stores energy and unleashes it on the backend.</p>\n<h2 class=\"p1\"><span>Specifications</span><br></h2>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Performance</strong></td>\n<td>Pro</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Part Number</strong></td>\n<td>60-108629-93X</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<strong>Color</strong><br>\n</td>\n<td>Sky Blue / Purple / Carbon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Core</strong></td>\n<td>Iron Fist V2<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Coverstock</strong></td>\n<td>HK22C² - Optimize Pearl<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cover Type</strong></td>\n<td>Pearl Reactive</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Finish</strong></td>\n<td>500, 1000, 1500 Siaair / Factory Compound</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Weights</strong></td>\n<td>16-12 Pounds</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lane Condition</strong></td>\n<td>Medium to oily<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Reaction</strong></td>\n<td>Strong mid-lane and backend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Warranty</strong></td>\n<td>Two years from purchase date </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Release Date</strong></td>\n<td>July 16, 2026</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Core Numbers</h2>\n<table style=\"width: 58.8031%;\" height=\"231\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36.2188px;\">\n<td sty